# Duplicating a task from the slash menu keeps editing the original, and deleting the copy from the slash menu later leaves navigate mode on the block after it.
file <<END
Work:
	- Report
		Draft due Friday
	- Slides
END
keys j <Enter>
type /dup
keys <Enter>
type  v1
keys <Esc>
see ▌   - Report v1
see     - Report
keys j j <Enter>
type /delete
keys <Enter>
see ▌   - Slides
status NAVIGATE
quit
saved <<END
Work:
	- Report v1
		Draft due Friday
	- Slides
END
